{"title":"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In the adjoining figure, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/b/c7bc69328ef74607767b467b2a851f202438edec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CDE$\" width=\"44\" height=\"12\" /> is an equilateral triangle and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/e/f9efaf9474c5658c4089523e2aff4e11488f8603.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"60\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/6/c16df895dad08efcc67a9a5d66f8eb08a7c37e8a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$DEFG$\" width=\"58\" height=\"12\" /> are squares. The measure of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/d/2ed9fd3239f32ac7a2d7f329c1e69d54250c9bd7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle GDA$\" width=\"56\" height=\"13\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/3/803ae3b681bdcf5fdc71d15f17eb671da753963f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)} \\ 90^\\circ \\qquad \\text{(B)} \\ 105^\\circ \\qquad \\text{(C)} \\ 120^\\circ \\qquad \\text{(D)} \\ 135^\\circ \\qquad \\text{(E)} \\ 150^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"449\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/1/ed18193c30c278c701f865fc597aef190814075a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] size(225); defaultpen(linewidth(0.7)+fontsize(10)); pair D=origin, C=D+dir(240), E=D+dir(300), F=E+dir(30), G=D+dir(30), A=D+dir(150), B=C+dir(150); draw(E--D--G--F--E--C--D--A--B--C); pair point=(0,0.5); label(&quot;$A$&quot;, A, dir(point--A)); label(&quot;$B$&quot;, B, dir(point--B)); label(&quot;$C$&quot;, C, dir(point--C)); label(&quot;$D$&quot;, D, dir(-15)); label(&quot;$E$&quot;, E, dir(point--E)); label(&quot;$F$&quot;, F, dir(point--F)); label(&quot;$G$&quot;, G, dir(point--G));[/asy]\" width=\"375\" height=\"195\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/e/f9efaf9474c5658c4089523e2aff4e11488f8603.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"60\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/6/c16df895dad08efcc67a9a5d66f8eb08a7c37e8a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$DEFG$\" width=\"58\" height=\"12\" /> are squares, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/8/f5899945601a48bf9f4cf0718d23de10d9c484a4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle ADC = \\angle GDE = 90^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"190\" height=\"15\" />.  Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/b/c7bc69328ef74607767b467b2a851f202438edec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CDE$\" width=\"44\" height=\"12\" /> is equilateral, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/3/653737822dc1c7ba29ceabe3ed1a39269417b10c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle CDE = 60^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"109\" height=\"15\" />.  So <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/9/1f96c3fb6025267f32fd1080e67a51e70855ade1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle GDA=360^\\circ-90^\\circ-60^\\circ-90^\\circ= \\boxed{(\\textbf{C})\\ 120^\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"365\" height=\"32\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME\" title=\"1980 AHSME\">1980 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1980 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1980\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_A